{"info": {"address1": "Gravlta Tower", "address2": "A-27B, Shanti Path Tilak Nagar", "city": "Jaipur", "zip": "302004", "country": "India", "phone": "91 14 126 2366", "fax": "91 14 1262 1491", "website": "https://www.gravitaindia.com", "industry": "Metal Fabrication", "industryKey": "metal-fabrication", "industryDisp": "Metal Fabrication", "sector": "Industrials", "sectorKey": "industrials", "sectorDisp": "Industrials", "longBusinessSummary": "Gravita India Limited manufactures and recycles lead metal, lead products, aluminium alloys, and plastic granules in India, the United Arab Emirates, South Korea, and internationally. It operates through Lead Processing, Aluminium Processing, Turn-Key Solutions, and Plastic Manufacturing segments. The company engages in smelting of lead battery scrap/lead concentrate to produce secondary lead metal, such as pure lead, specific lead alloy, lead oxides, and lead products like lead sheets, lead powder, lead shot, etc.; granules, including polypropylene, polycarbonate, HDPE, and ABS; trading of taint tabor and tense aluminium scraps; and manufacture of alloy from melting of aluminium scrap. It also offers consultancy services for recycling operations; turnkey solutions for recycling processes and solutions; procures raw materials which include battery, aluminium, plastic, and rubber scrap; and extended producer responsibility recycler and compliance services. The company also exports its products. Gravita India Limited was incorporated in 1992 and is based in Jaipur, India.", "companyOfficers": [{"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Rajat  Agrawal", "age": 58, "title": "Founder, MD & Executive Non-Independent Chairman", "yearBorn": 1967, "fiscalYear": 2025, "totalPay": 66591000, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Dr. Yogesh  Malhotra", "age": 57, "title": "CEO & Whole Time Director", "yearBorn": 1968, "fiscalYear": 2025, "totalPay": 47356000, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": 